        <excerpt>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[Centro is a global business process outsourcing company operating contact centers for clients across healthcare, retail, and financial services. This post explains how our quality assurance process works and how it supports a 91% customer satisfaction rate.]]></Value>
    </excerpt>
